1
00:00:00,833 --> 00:00:02,566
The Lu Group is eyeing the Gu family's weakness

2
00:00:02,566 --> 00:00:04,166
They won't make a move anytime soon

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,500
But Gu Chengze will look into you

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,366
He already has

5
00:00:06,766 --> 00:00:07,966
He's still using the same old tricks

6
00:00:08,066 --> 00:00:08,866
Worried

7
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:09,900
If he finds nothing

8
00:00:09,966 --> 00:00:11,633
he'll find a way to label you

9
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:18,833
For the Fu family to verify identity

10
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:19,966
one of the key clues

11
00:00:20,166 --> 00:00:21,466
is the old scar on the left wrist

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,800
What are you looking at

13
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,500
Your hand

14
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:26,900
Old scar

15
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,233
Got it when I was a kid

16
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:30,100
Can't remember much

17
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,900
If someone tells you one day

18
00:00:31,966 --> 00:00:33,633
you could have had another identity

19
00:00:33,633 --> 00:00:34,600
what would you do

20
00:00:34,633 --> 00:00:35,633
What do you know

21
00:00:35,766 --> 00:00:36,800
I just think

22
00:00:36,966 --> 00:00:38,666
you shouldn't always be called a bodyguard

23
00:00:38,666 --> 00:00:39,866
I don't care what others call me

24
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,000
It's enough that you know who I am

25
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,000
Are you going back

26
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,766
Did you know all along

27
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:59,000
The day you chose me you said three months

28
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,000
later they would beg me to look at them
